  "details": "I'm fairly certain that before the persistence update, serialization events for a deactivated UdonBehaviour would not be buffered. \n\nThe new behavior causes a lot of trouble for worlds that relied on that behavior.\n\nHow to reproduce:\n\n- Deactivate an object for a non-owner\n\n- Call RequestSerialization from the owner client\n\n- Activate the object\n\nThe object then receives all serialization events.\n\nHere is a test world (Output is in the log):\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_80300df4-da29-4f40-ae99-dddfd2820767/info",
